Rockchip RK3326 boot firmware

The boot images contain prebuilt firmware, not firmware built from source.
The default R36LLM_UBOOT=vendor5606e80 uses the working card's set:
DDR v1.10, miniloader v1.12, BL31 v1.14, BL32 v1.10.
The optional R36LLM_UBOOT=clone4820a71 build selects one of two sets:
A (R36LLM_FIRMWARE_VARIANT=A): DDR v1.10, miniloader v1.40, BL31 v1.34, BL32 v2.19.
B (default): DDR v1.10, miniloader v1.12, BL31 v1.14, BL32 v1.10.
B matches the working G80CA-MB Panel 8 card's firmware payloads.
U-Boot itself is built from source in both modes.

